# Numeric palettes and fonts

[简体中文](THEME_REVIEW.zh-CN.md) · [License scope](LEGAL.en.md)

## Palette decision: retain

| Compatibility key | Chinese label | Numeric/color label |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| unit01 | 初·绿紫 | 01 · Green/Purple |
| unit00 | 零·蓝银 | 00 · Blue/Silver |
| unit02 | 二·赤橙 | 02 · Red/Orange |
| unit08 | 八·桃绿 | 08 · Pink/Green |
| mark06 | 六·蓝金 | 06 · Blue/Gold |
| mono | 素·黑白 | Mono |

Ordinary palettes, geometric lines and instrument-style layout remain; Mono is the default. Internal keys preserve configuration compatibility while visible names use numbers/colors. No official logos, character art, animation frames, audio or proprietary theme font are bundled. Names do not imply endorsement.

[Actual main-window captures of all six palettes](../README.en.md#themes)

## Font decision: retain the current open fonts

Noto Serif SC, Roboto Condensed and Share Tech Mono match their official files byte-for-byte. Copyright and license files remain alongside them. Matisse is neither bundled nor automatically preferred from the local system.

The included open-font licenses permit this noncommercial learning use without separate authorization for that purpose. Other upstream-permitted uses remain available. No glyph edits/subsetting were made; CSS aliases do not alter internal reserved names. Roboto's historical embedded Apache notice is also retained. [Official OFL FAQ](https://openfontlicense.org/ofl-faq/)

The EVA-related Matisse product has separate commercial terms and is not used in this candidate. [Product source](https://mojimo.jp/eva/)

New fonts/assets require an updated provenance record and their own terms. The retained palettes are not repeatedly treated as unresolved publication choices.
